# =================================================================
# LegalMate Root - Environment Configuration Overview
# =================================================================
# LegalMate is architected as a MERN stack application with decoupled
# frontend and backend services:
#
# 1. Backend Service: see backend/.env.example
#    - Requires MONGODB_URI, JWT_SECRET, FRONTEND_URL, and AI Keys.
#
# 2. Frontend Client: see frontend/.env.example
#    - Requires VITE_API_URL pointing to the Backend service.
#
# For production deployments:
# - Backend -> Render / Railway (Node.js Web Service)
# - Frontend -> Vercel / Netlify (Vite Static / SPA Site)
# - Database -> MongoDB Atlas (Cloud M0 Cluster)
